# ── Published papers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The PDFs in papers/ are copyrighted (Elsevier, Springer, IEEE). This repository is
# PUBLIC, so committing them would redistribute paywalled work. They are referenced by
# citation in docs/PIPELINE.md instead. Keep them locally; do not commit.
papers/*.pdf
papers/*.PDF

# ── Regenerable training data ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# 66 MB, and `src/build_groups.py --seed 42` reproduces it deterministically in ~4 min.
# A 200-line sample of each split is committed under data/groups/samples/ so the schema
# is visible without cloning 66 MB.
data/groups/group_examples_*.jsonl

# ── Local data that is not ours to publish ─────────────────────────────────
# The Foursquare check-in CSVs come from TSMC2014 / FSQ-OS Places and are obtained via
# the project's Kaggle datasets, not redistributed here.
data/train_*.csv
data/val_*.csv
data/test_*.csv
data/poi_metadata_*.csv
data/vocab.pkl
data/*.npy

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
